<BaseLayout title="Insights | Lead Strategy" description="Research and practical guidance on websites, search, advertising, content and digital commerce in Canada.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Insights" title="Useful before it is promotional." lead="Research and practical guidance for Canadian operators. Every article will answer a real buyer question, disclose commercial relationships and pass editorial and technical QA before publication." />
	<section class="section shell">
		<div class="notice"><strong>Editorial program in production</strong><span>The launch backlog is being researched now. Drafts will not be presented as published evidence.</span></div>
		<div class="editorial-list" style="margin-top: 50px;">
			<article class="editorial-item"><span class="editorial-item__meta">PLANNED GUIDE</span><div><h2>What a Canadian small-business website should cost</h2><p>A transparent breakdown of scope, ownership, platform and ongoing operating costs.</p></div><span class="editorial-item__meta">BUILD</span></article>
			<article class="editorial-item"><span class="editorial-item__meta">PLANNED RESEARCH</span><div><h2>Where local service enquiries get lost</h2><p>From the first search through the form, inbox, calendar and follow-up.</p></div><span class="editorial-item__meta">MARKET</span></article>
			<article class="editorial-item"><span class="editorial-item__meta">PLANNED PLAYBOOK</span><div><h2>Launching a digital product in Canada</h2><p>Delivery, tax, licensing, accessibility, refunds and the minimum useful storefront.</p></div><span class="editorial-item__meta">SELL</span></article>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
